             PGM        /*MCXCLRPFMN*/
/**************************************************************************/
/* THIS PROGRAM CAN BE USED TO PERFORM A CLEAR PHYSICAL FILE COMMAND      */
/* (CLRPFM) ON EACH CSIS/MMIS/CSAS "NON-DATABASE" PHYSICAL FILE.          */
/*                                                                        */
/* THIS PROGRAM INCLUDES CLRPFM COMMANDS FOR RELEASE H.01 PHYSICAL FILES  */
/* OTHER THAN THOSE HAVING NUMERIC SUFFIXES AND THE FOLLOWING PREFIXES:   */
/*    MCFPBG  MCFPCA  MCFPCS  MCFPDF  MCFPMM  MCFPPW  MCFPST MCFPZP       */
/*                                                                        */
/* SPECIAL NOTES:                                                         */
/* - PHYSICAL FILES SUCH AS: MCFPBG0100, MCFPCS2400, AND MCFPZP0100 WILL  */
/*      NOT BE AFFECTED BY THIS PROGRAM.                                  */
/*                                                                        */
/* - THIS PROGRAM IS HARDCODED TO CLEAR PHYSICAL FILES IN LIBRARY MCPRD1. */
/**************************************************************************/
/* 27FEB1995 REMOVED FILE INVLESSVEN FROM THIS PROGRAM.  ---DAVE PLUM     */
/**************************************************************************/
             CLRPFM     FILE(MCPRD1/ABSTFIL2)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             CLRPFM     FILE(MCPRD1/ABSTFIL3)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
